From 015cafbeb691bd0fb58fb0ed680cd95d9f76ddd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 09:26:32 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): offer stock fitting only for parametric shapes

Hide source-stock fit controls and retire stale setup feedback when the
draft shape changes. Pin control visibility, Delete routing and refusal
lifecycle with structural tests.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1683
